<title>USA: U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soymeal export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 34,300 MT were 64 percent below the previous week and 58 percent under the 4-week average.  Major increases for Turkey (27,200 MT), Italy (26,100 MT), Egypt (25,000 MT), and Guatemala (21,100 MT) were partially offset by reductions for unknown destinations (59,000 MT), Israel (25,000 MT), and China (20,000 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 114,200 MT were 36 percent below the previous week and 48 percent below the 4-week average. Turkey (47,700 MT), Italy (26,100 MT), and Venezuela (16,400 MT) were the major recipients</p>
</text>
